<section class="section" id="features"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head reveal"><div class="kicker">Everything in one workspace</div><h2>From “let’s host a race”<br>to “see you at the finish line.”</h2><p>Skip the messy spreadsheets and scattered messages. Keep your event setup, registrations and race-day check-in connected in one place.</p></div>
 <div class="features-grid">
  <article class="feature-card reveal"><span class="feature-number">01</span><div class="feature-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="17" rx="3"/><path d="M16 2v4M8 2v4M3 10h18M8 14h3M8 17h7"/></svg></div><h3>Your event, your landing page</h3><p>Publish a separate public page for every marathon, with your organization's identity, race details, distances and a clear Join Now button.</p></article>
  <article class="feature-card reveal"><span class="feature-number">02</span><div class="feature-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 4h16v16H4zM8 8h8M8 12h8M8 16h5"/></svg></div><h3>Registration that fits your race</h3><p>Choose the participant details you need, such as contact information, race distance, age range and your own custom questions.</p></article>
  <article class="feature-card reveal"><span class="feature-number">03</span><div class="feature-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7"/><path d="M14 14h3v3h-3zM20 14v2M17 20h4"/></svg></div><h3>One QR pass per participant</h3><p>Give each registration a unique number and QR-based participant pass that can be used at the event check-in desk.</p></article>
  <article class="feature-card reveal"><span class="feature-number">04</span><div class="feature-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 3-6.7"/><path d="M3 4v5h5M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg></div><h3>Race-day attendance</h3><p>Scan the participant QR code or look up a registration number to check in and record the arrival time.</p></article>
  <article class="feature-card reveal"><span class="feature-number">05</span><div class="feature-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.1 0l3-3A5 5 0 0 0 13 2.9l-1.7 1.7"/><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.1 0l-3 3A5 5 0 0 0 11 21.1l1.7-1.7"/></svg></div><h3>Share one simple link</h3><p>Share your event page with students, runners, clubs or communities. Participants open the page and register from their phone.</p></article>
