 </div></div></section>
<section class="section how" id="how-it-works"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head reveal"><div class="kicker">Simple from day one</div><h2>Three steps. One smoother race.</h2><p>EventFlow helps you turn event details into a shareable registration experience and an easier check-in process.</p></div><div class="steps">
 <article class="step-card reveal"><span class="step-num">01</span><h3>Create your event</h3><p>Add the marathon name, date, venue, race distances, fee, capacity and the participant fields your event needs.</p><span class="step-arrow">→</span></article>
 <article class="step-card reveal"><span class="step-num">02</span><h3>Publish & share</h3><p>Give runners one event link. They open your branded landing page, choose the registration options and submit their details.</p><span class="step-arrow">→</span></article>
 <article class="step-card reveal"><span class="step-num">03</span><h3>Scan & check in</h3><p>Use the participant's QR pass or unique registration number to mark attendance and record check-in time.</p></article>
 </div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="participant-pass"><div class="shell pass-section"><div class="pass-copy reveal"><div class="kicker">A pass for every runner</div><h2>From registration confirmation to the starting line.</h2><p>Every participant should know what to show on race day. A clear pass puts their event details and unique registration identity in one easy-to-find place.</p><div class="check-list"><div class="check-item"><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg></span><span>Participant name, event, mobile number and unique registration code.</span></div><div class="check-item"><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg></span><span>QR code designed to make race-day identity lookup faster.</span></div><div class="check-item"><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg></span><span>Designed for mobile screens, with downloadable pass options in the participant workflow.</span></div></div><div style="margin-top:28px"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/signup.php">Create your first event <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div></div>
 <div class="pass-visual reveal"><div class="side-bubble left"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg>Registration confirmed</div><article class="ticket" aria-label="Illustration of a participant race pass"><div class="ticket-top"><div class="ticket-brand"><span>EF</span> EVENTFLOW · RACE PASS</div><h3>YOUR NEXT<br>FINISH LINE.</h3><p>PARTICIPANT ENTRY PASS</p></div><div class="ticket-body"><div class="ticket-info"><div><span>PARTICIPANT</span><strong>Your Name</strong></div><div><span>RACE CATEGORY</span><strong>5K · 10K · 21K</strong></div><div><span>EVENT</span><strong>Marathon Name</strong></div><div><span>REGISTRATION ID</span><strong>EF · 000123</strong></div></div><div class="ticket-divider"></div><div class="ticket-bottom"><div class="ticket-code"><small>SHOW THIS PASS AT CHECK-IN</small>READY TO RUN</div><div class="ticket-qr" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><div class="ticket-note">Illustration only · Actual pass details are filled from the participant's registration.</div></div></article><div class="side-bubble right"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 3-6.7"/><path d="M3 4v5h5"/></svg>Scan · Verify · Check in</div></div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="faq" style="padding-top:15px"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head reveal"><div class="kicker">Good to know</div><h2>Questions, answered.</h2><p>A quick look at how EventFlow fits into your event workflow.</p></div><div style="max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;gap:11px">
 <details class="faq-item reveal"><summary>Who is EventFlow for?</summary><p>Organizations, schools, clubs and teams that organize marathons, running races and community events.</p></details>
 <details class="faq-item reveal"><summary>Can every event have its own public page?</summary><p>Yes. Each event is intended to have its own shareable page with the organizer's branding and the event's details.</p></details>
 <details class="faq-item reveal"><summary>Can the registration form be customized?</summary><p>The event setup supports configurable registration fields so organizers can collect the details relevant to their participants. The available options depend on the current installed version.</p></details>
 <details class="faq-item reveal"><summary>Does EventFlow currently accept online payments?</summary><p>Online payment collection is not enabled in the current setup. Registration and payment tracking should not be treated as proof that a payment has been received.</p></details>
 <details class="faq-item reveal"><summary>How does check-in work?</summary><p>The intended flow is to scan a participant's QR pass or enter their registration number, then record the check-in time in the organizer's workspace.</p></details>
 </div></div></section>
